### 画面1: ログイン画面

```
Context:
Design a mobile app login screen for "TierHub" - a tier list creation and social sharing app where users create rankings for games, anime, and other content.

User:
Young adults (20-30s) who enjoy creating and sharing tier lists about games, anime, and pop culture. Tech-savvy, prefer quick onboarding.

Goal of the screen:
Allow users to quickly sign in using social authentication (Google, Apple) without friction.

Screen type:
Login / Onboarding (iOS-style mobile UI)

Layout & hierarchy:
- Top section: App logo and tagline "Create. Share. Rank Everything."
- Middle section: Social login buttons (Google, Apple)
- Bottom section: Terms of service link

Components:
- Large centered app logo
- "Sign in with Google" button with Google icon
- "Sign in with Apple" button with Apple icon
- Small text link for terms and privacy policy

Visual direction:
- Dark theme (dark gray background #212121)
- Minimal, clean, modern
- Accent color: Blue (#2196F3) for interactive elements
- Simple sans-serif font
- No heavy illustrations

Constraints:
- One-hand usage
- Large touch targets for buttons (minimum 48px height)
- Accessible contrast ratios (WCAG 2.1 AA)

Output expectation:
Generate a clean, dark-themed mobile login screen that emphasizes simplicity and quick social sign-in.
```

